    {
      "text": "A forest plot of test specificity (%) in two studies in low-incidence settings (Aggerbeck 2013 and Ruhwald 2017), with random-effects pooled estimates: TST 15mm 93.31% (90.22–95.48), IGRA 99.15% (79.66–99.97) and C-Tb 97.85% (93.96–99.25). The x-axis runs from 80 to 100.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
